WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.300
Nominated for four Academy Awards,

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.300
including Best Director and Best Adapted Screenplay.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.800
Rio de Janeiro.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.300
The beach.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.800
The nightlife.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.400
The romance.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.500
But fifteen miles from paradise

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.900
is a place called the City of God.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.500
A place where one man must infiltrate a war

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.600
between two crime lords

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.800
to tell a story

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.000
the world needs to know.
